      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了慰劳她，\n我正在计划是否能以「香港式」的做法\n陪她庆祝情人节。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a8e096dcbf54b5271b478b5152599da1921092e208f5e31215c5d3e5218168e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
