    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa17f68776e125ae884aab08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我摸着身上这套穿起来舒适得惊人的套装……\n进餐厅前，她说着「这是回礼」\n然后要我换上这套衣服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "601c02fd4ea1b4ea8826433200d0b0b40d8a4f2b508c6ae6b8f3c18a4db1fa36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
